Surface interpolation and intermediate projection code derives from the Rust
case-8 port of MPAS-A v8.4.2. The original MPAS BSD-3-Clause terms are in
LICENSE-MPAS-BSD-3-Clause.txt. This modified version adds parallel acquisition,
concurrent intermediate decoding, rayon cell loops, snow depth output, and
native time-series NetCDF output with provenance. It is a modified version of
the original software and is not an official MPAS release.

The generic intermediate decoder is seeded from the engine tools/grib1_bridge
src/bin/met_intermediate.rs at revision 63d4aae472f6f138b0c8b5ca1467e58648f4c78b.
It retains its Vtable-driven field maps and repairs, with parallel field decode
and deterministic ordered merging. It is part of the source-owned producer.
